  "result": "full profile pair can run concurrently after shared frontend phases, conditional on exact isolated invocation below",
  "scope": "Read-only isolation and workflow-equivalence assessment; not execution or production acceptance. Original full cycle remains active/unmodified.",
  "conditions": [
    "After original jobs physically join and reviewed fixes apply, run typecheck, lint, full Vitest and embedded build sequentially exactly as npm test:cycle. Freeze sources/embeds then invoke unchanged scripts/run-e2e.sh once for each real profile, no filter arguments.",
    "Use distinct18471/18472ports, same new owned output root with existing profile suffixes, per-profile fresh0700private TMPDIR and per-profile APEXLOAD_IMPORT_ASSET_DIR. Wrapper may isolate temporary namespaces via environment without repository changes.",
    "Do not install/update shared Playwright/browser/module/node dependencies during either profile; pinned existing caches are readable by independent driver/browser processes.",
    "Each wrapper child must have its own retained log, preserve nonzero result and physically wait/join both children plus script-owned controller cleanup before combined verdict. If either fails, combined gate is RED; do not replace either profile with smoke/filtered coverage.",
    "For resource pressure, start fullGo2 after both script controller builds have completed and both exact profiles are healthy; preserve all existing workers/retries/timeouts/limits and source/embed bookends. Do not remove caches while any dependent job remains."
  ],
  "evidence": [
    "run-e2e.sh allocates unique mktemp controller binary/SQLite database/archive dir, binds supplied port and cleanup kills/waits only owned PID; local-auth persists own settings and restarts only own controller.",
    "playwright.config.ts uses one worker and zero retries per process; outputDir and JUnit both append exact profile. No shared global setup/teardown or disk storageState path.",
    "All8 actual Node fixture listeners found in suite use listen(0,127.0.0.1). Other fixed endpoint values are DSL/import test data, not fixture listening ports.",
    "Fixture file mutations are two unique mkdtemp trees and one testInfo.outputPath geometry receipt; HTTPS openssl writes inside unique certificate tree. Upload fixtures are read-only and ZIP helper returns stdout bytes.",
    "Authentication browser/storage state is context/process local; controller login rate limit and persisted settings scoped to each independent SQLite store.",
    "DefaultImportAssetDir is os.TempDir/apexload-import-assets and Bruno defaults underneath it; HAR staging/maintenance also defaults to os.TempDir. Fresh per-profile TMPDIR and explicit import-root isolate these namespaces from one another and Go tests. Native analytics durable artifacts derive profile archive backend root.",
    "Playwright Run checks already installed pinned driver and launches a private connection; it does not install or mutate shared versioned driver files. No e2e browser-install endpoint call found."
  ],
